{"ticker":{"symbol":"002380.KS","name":"KCC","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":373500.0,"change_pct":-0.005326231691078598,"market_cap":2746782842880.0,"pe":10.067318,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.040160642570281124,"week52_low":336000.0,"week52_high":692000.0,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Chemicals","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":3287,"website":"https://www.kccworld.co.kr","business_summary":"KCC Corporation provides building materials in South Korea and internationally. Its building materials include celling materials, insulation materials, gypsum board, and flooring materials. The company offers window profiles, balcony window profiles, system window profiles, and sense doors; interior decorative materials, such as flooring materials and laminate films; float, functional, and automotive glass products; decorative, automotive, marine, plant, and industrial coatings; and organic and inorganic materials. In addition, it engages in silicone business for developing products in the fields of specialized paints and precision chemical engineering. KCC Corporation was founded in 1958 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"KCC코퍼레이션은 국내외 건축자재를 공급하고 있습니다. 건축자재로는 셀링재, 단열재, 석고보드, 바닥재 등이 있습니다. 이 회사는 창 프로필, 발코니 창 프로필, 시스템 창 프로필 및 감지 도어를 제공합니다. 바닥재, 라미네이트 필름 등의 내장재; 플로트, 기능성 및 자동차 유리 제품; 장식용, 자동차용, 해양용, 식물용, 산업용 코팅; 그리고 유기 및 무기 재료. 또한 특수도료, 정밀화학공학 분야의 제품 개발을 위한 실리콘 사업도 영위하고 있습니다. KCC Corporation은 1958년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":6761475000000.0,"rev_lo":6659000000000.0,"rev_hi":6901000000000.0,"rev_g":0.0428,"n":4,"eps":167723.25,"eps_lo":97942.0,"eps_hi":308869.0,"eps_g":-0.1983},{"period":"2027","rev":7117025000000.0,"rev_lo":6905000000000.0,"rev_hi":7259100000000.0,"rev_g":0.052600004,"n":4,"eps":37100.25,"eps_lo":17813.0,"eps_hi":55395.0,"eps_g":-0.77879995}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"화학","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":67747